Operating within the Spanish residential construction market, 011h employs a business model centered on prefabricated building systems. These systems use circular, low-carbon materials such as mass timber, which are both sustainable and efficient. By leveraging a robust network of top-tier manufacturers and suppliers, 011h ensures streamlined project procurement and execution, resulting in timely and cost-effective project delivery.

The company generates revenue through its partnerships with residential developers and municipal housing authorities, providing them with sustainable construction solutions that meet modern environmental standards. By focusing on net zero construction, 011h not only addresses the growing demand for sustainable living spaces but also positions itself as a leader in the transition to a sustainable built environment.

Looking ahead, 011h plans to reinvest its profits to expand its model into other market segments and regions. Additionally, the company aims to gradually open up its digital tools and methodologies to enable anyone, anywhere, to build net zero structures. This strategy will help scale their positive impact and accelerate the global shift towards sustainable construction practices.

