The company''s services are applicable across multiple use cases and industries. For instance, it can be used for opening bank accounts in compliance with Anti-Money Laundering (AML) and Know Your Customer (KYC) regulations. It can also be used for driver registration, where it speeds up the identity verification process and protects the fleet by discouraging those who intend to steal or damage vehicles. In the hospitality industry, Alice Biometrics can enhance guest experience by offering a seamless check-in solution.

Alice Biometrics also offers omnichannel user verification. This means that from physical stores to online platforms, businesses can completely digitize the onboarding and activation of their customers. It also allows for remote identity verification and digital contract signing. The company''s technology can also detect fake accounts, thereby increasing community security and preventing identity theft.

In the betting and gaming industry, Alice Biometrics can verify customers'' identities while checking their age and whether they appear on exclusion lists. This allows businesses to easily register customers while ensuring regulatory compliance.

The company makes money by charging its clients for the use of its identity verification services.

