APlanet provides a Software-as-a-Service (SaaS) platform designed to help organizations manage, track, and report their Environmental, Social, and Governance (ESG) data. The business primarily serves companies of all sizes, from SMEs to large multinationals, that need to comply with evolving sustainability regulations or voluntarily improve their ESG performance. Its business model is based on providing technological solutions that automate data collection, centralize non-financial information, and simplify reporting for various international standards such as CSRD, GRI, IFRS, and GHG protocols. By streamlining these processes, APlanet''s platform aims to save its clients significant time and resources, turning complex ESG requirements into a manageable and strategic function. 

The core product is a modular ESG management and analysis platform. One key module, SUSTAINABILITY, offers a comprehensive solution for data management, providing customizable dashboards, real-time analytics, and automated workflows. Other specialized modules include NEUTRALITY, which focuses on carbon footprint calculation and decarbonization, and MATERIALITY, a tool to guide businesses through the double materiality analysis required by regulations like CSRD. The platform is built for flexibility, allowing clients to customize KPIs and reporting processes to fit their specific organizational structure. A primary benefit highlighted by users is the significant reduction in time spent on data collection—from a typical six-month process to as little as two months—by unifying all non-financial data in a single, auditable location. The company''s growth has been recognized, ranking 13th in the Deloitte Technology Fast 50 for Spain, citing a 421% growth over four years. 

Keywords: ESG management, sustainability reporting, CSRD compliance, GHG protocol, non-financial data, SaaS platform, corporate social responsibility, carbon footprint tracking, sustainability software, ESG data automation, GRI standards, IFRS sustainability, environmental governance, social governance, double materiality analysis, sustainable development, ESG analytics, compliance management, impact reporting, value chain sustainability', '["accelerator","data management","database","Climate Fintech","data security","sales","Venture Capital","e-commerce platforms","web fonts","Industry 4.0","Climate Action (#13)","online form builders","Big Data","editors","ad exchanges","marketing","Subscription","SaaS","marketing automation","customer relationship management","Angel","frameworks and libraries","development","content management system","other advertising software","online video platforms","marketing analytics","marketing performance measurement","it infrastructure","web frameworks","source code management","b2b","web platform extensions","tag management","widgets","web servers","search engines","Hard Tech","content delivery network","programming languages","audio-video-graphics","advertising","infrastructure as a service","payment processing","error and exception monitoring","website builders","virtualisation software","miscellaneous","programming","caching","cloud infrastructure computing","e-commerce","dev tools","javascript libraries","wordpress plugins","intelligence and analytics","video players","Enterprise Software","analytics","devops","Legal","security","Sustainable Development Goals","issue trackers","Climate Tech","operating systems & computing languages","web analytics","javascript frameworks","consent management","Early stage","font scripts","social networks","blogs","ui frameworks","Sustainability Measurement","Woman Founder","maps","web tools and plugins"]', '["startup","vc_backed","funded"]', 69.04, 5200, 0, 0, 16666660, NULL, NULL, -1149300, 2023,