The company''s core business is a "Lunch as a Benefit" model, providing healthy, daily meal delivery services directly to offices and, accommodating the hybrid work model, to employees'' homes. This B2B approach helps client companies improve their employer value proposition, boost productivity, and increase talent retention. ApetEat also serves individual customers (B2C) who can order without a corporate agreement. Its business model relies on logistical optimization by concentrating deliveries within corporate settings. Revenue is generated from the sale of meals, with a delivery fee applied to smaller home orders. 

The service offers a menu based on the Mediterranean diet, designed by an in-house nutritionist, with a focus on fresh, seasonal ingredients and additive-free recipes. The platform caters to a variety of dietary needs, including vegetarian and vegan options. A key milestone was the acquisition of Felix Oficina in January 2020, strengthening its position in the market. The company has secured approximately $2.95M in funding from investors including Big Sur Ventures, All Iron Ventures, and accelerators like Lanzadera and Google for Startups. ApetEat is also committed to social and environmental responsibility, using 100% ecological, compostable packaging and donating surplus food to charitable foundations. Keywords: corporate catering, employee benefits, food delivery, healthy meals, office lunch, B2B food service, Lunch as a Benefit, Mediterranean diet, food-tech, workplace wellness, corporate food solutions, meal delivery service, Madrid, employee engagement, talent retention, sustainable packaging, social responsibility, daily menu, office catering, corporate wellness', '["Health Platform","corporate","accelerator","photo galleries","Venture Capital","web frameworks","b2b","widgets","Hard Tech","programming languages","Commission","javascript libraries","analytics","Health","b2c","javascript frameworks","Marketplace & ecommerce","Early stage","font scripts"]', '["startup","vc_backed","funded"]', 71.2, 13000, 0, 0, 4999998, NULL, NULL, -270499, 2023, '[{"year":2022,"revenue":863652,"ebitda":null,"profit":-631898,"rnd":null,"valuation":4999998,"employees":21},{"year":2023,"revenue":1378532,"ebitda":null,"profit":-270499,"rnd":null,"valuation":4999998,"employees":21},{"year":2024,"revenue":1378532,"ebitda":null,"profit":-270499,"rnd":null,"valuation":4999998,"employees":18},{"year":2025,"revenue":1378532,"ebitda":null,"profit":-270499,"rnd":null,"valuation":4999998,"employees":21},{"year":2026,"revenue":1378532,"ebitda":null,"profit":-270499,"rnd":null,"valuation":499