The business model is centered around the sale of franchises, which allows partners to operate under the Aquí tu Reforma brand. This model includes a technological platform that digitizes the operations of the renovation companies, aiming to improve efficiency and customer experience. The company also emphasizes sustainability, offering solutions that are environmentally friendly and cater to the growing demand for green renovations.

Aquí tu Reforma primarily serves the residential market, targeting homeowners who are looking for reliable and professional renovation services. The company operates in a high-demand sector with significant growth potential. Its revenue is generated through franchise fees and a percentage of the renovation projects carried out by its network of franchisees. The company has attracted investment from major corporations like Iberdrola and Roca, which has helped to fuel its expansion.

