The firm''s core offering is a sophisticated revenue management platform designed to help hotels and other hospitality businesses maximize their profitability. Beonx''s platform leverages a patented Hotel Quality Index (HQI), which analyzes a property''s online reputation and specific characteristics to provide a more accurate and holistic approach to pricing recommendations. This system moves beyond traditional competitor-based pricing, allowing clients to understand their property''s true market position and set optimal rates accordingly. The platform integrates artificial intelligence to analyze a multitude of data points, including market demand, competitor pricing, and historical data, to forecast and recommend pricing strategies. 

The business model is primarily subscription-based, offering its software-as-a-service (SaaS) platform to a diverse client base that includes independent hotels, large hotel chains, and other accommodation providers. By automating complex pricing decisions, Beonx enables hoteliers to increase key performance indicators such as Revenue Per Available Room (RevPAR) and occupancy rates. The company has demonstrated consistent growth, underscored by a significant €2.5 million funding round in 2019 led by K Fund, and a subsequent €6.7 million investment in 2024 to fuel further international expansion. Having started with a focus on the Spanish market, Beonx has successfully expanded its footprint globally, with a significant presence in Europe and Latin America, serving thousands of properties across more than 30 countries. 

Keywords: revenue management system, hospitality technology, SaaS, hotel pricing, profit optimization, artificial intelligence, RevPAR, hotel quality index, property technology, dynamic pricing', '["accelerator","database","sales","photo galleries","accounting","Predictive Analytics","Pricing","Venture Capital","e-commerce platforms","web fonts","Big Data","marketing","Core AI","Subscription","SaaS","marketing automation","javascript graphics","customer relationship management","Price Comparison","Accommodation","Angel","frameworks and libraries","content management system","marketing analytics","system analytics & monitoring","marketing performance measurement","DT and LS","it infrastructure","web frameworks","open source","Cloud Computing","b2b","web platform extensions","Artificial Intelligence","Revenue Management","widgets","web servers","search engines","software framework","programming languages","Breakout stage","Travel","audio-video-graphics","web and application servers","miscellaneous","programming","AI Applications","Analytics","javascript libraries","wordpress plugins","intelligence and analytics","video players","Enterprise Software","analytics","web analytics","javascript frameworks","Travel","live chat","font scripts","Business Intelligence","blogs","ui frameworks","accounting and finance","Deep Tech","Machine Learning","Travel Analytics & Software","web tools and plugins"]', '["startup","vc_backed","funded"]', 59.6, 9700, 0, 0, 10416662, -971575, 2021, -1205789, 2024, '[{"year":2015,"revenue":512621,"ebitda":-21763,"profit":-48117,"rnd":null,"valuation":null,"employees":null},{"year":2016,"revenue":750000,"ebitda":-21763,"profit":-48117,"rnd":null,"valuation":null,"employees":null},{"year":2017,"revenue":882129,"ebitda":-375594,"profit":-437935,"rnd":null,"valuation":6999997,"employees":null},{"year":2018,"revenue":1189150,"ebitda":-565016,"profit":-706592,"rnd":null,"valuation":6999997,"employees":null},{"year":2019,"revenue":1565243,"ebitda":-1488