The platform offers a comprehensive solution for talent acquisition and management, enabling companies to fill skills gaps through better recruitment, employee development, and redeployment to critical projects. It also facilitates skills-based hiring, which can speed up hiring cycles, reduce costs, and attract the right talent. 

Beamery''s business model is based on a software-as-a-service (SaaS) model, where clients pay a subscription fee to use the platform. This model provides a steady stream of recurring revenue for the company. 

The platform also helps improve employee engagement, retention, and development by enabling employees to identify and apply for roles within the organization. This has resulted in a 2.5x improvement in retention for its clients. 

In addition, Beamery promotes diversity and inclusivity in the workforce. It offers personalized candidate experiences, tailored mentorship and development opportunities, and tools to identify potential bias. This has led to a 3x increase in diverse talent for its clients. 

According to a study by Forrester Consulting, Beamery delivered a 467% return on investment (ROI) for its customers, along with efficiency gains, improved quality of hire, and better experiences for candidates, recruiters, and sourcers. 

