By eliminating the traditional retail markups from middlemen, celebrity endorsements, and expensive marketing campaigns, Beauty Pie provides its members with high-end products without the associated luxury price tags. The company sources its formulations from the same leading laboratories that supply many of the world''s most recognized and premium beauty brands, ensuring a high standard of quality.

This model targets discerning consumers who are more interested in the quality and efficacy of the ingredients than in brand names or elaborate packaging. The market for Beauty Pie is, therefore, individuals who seek transparency and value in their beauty purchases. Revenue is generated primarily through membership fees, with different tiers available to suit varying customer needs and spending habits. This creates a steady and predictable income stream for the company, while the sale of products at near-cost prices fosters customer loyalty and encourages regular purchases.

