Bloom & Wild serves a broad range of clients, from individuals looking to send a thoughtful gift, to businesses seeking corporate flower services. The company operates primarily in the UK, but also offers delivery to several European countries.

The business model of Bloom & Wild is based on both one-off purchases and subscription services. Customers can order individual bouquets for special occasions or opt for a regular flower delivery through a subscription model. This recurring revenue stream provides a stable income for the company and encourages customer loyalty.

Bloom & Wild generates revenue through the sale of its flower arrangements and subscriptions. The company also offers add-on products such as vases and chocolates, providing additional income streams. 

Bloom & Wild has leveraged technology to enhance its business operations. The company uses data analytics to understand customer preferences and optimize its product offerings. It also utilizes various digital marketing strategies to reach a wider audience and drive sales.

