Bob.io''s business model revolves around charging a fee for each baggage check-in service, independent of the airline''s baggage fees. The company also offers additional services such as managing excess baggage costs and providing flexibility for changes and cancellations up to two hours before pick-up. By focusing on customer convenience, safety, and time efficiency, Bob.io aims to minimize the risks associated with prolonged airport stays and social distancing concerns.

The company generates revenue through direct service fees paid by customers, and potentially through partnerships with airlines and travel agencies. This model allows Bob.io to cater to a wide range of clients, from individual travelers to corporate clients, enhancing their travel experience by reducing stress and saving time.

