Carwow''s business model is centered around facilitating transactions between car buyers and sellers. It allows sellers to list their cars for sale, and buyers can browse these listings, compare prices, and make purchases. The platform also offers a bidding feature, where over 4,000 dealers across the UK can bid on listed cars. This competitive environment ensures that sellers get the best possible price for their vehicles. 

In addition to its marketplace function, Carwow also provides a wealth of information for car enthusiasts and potential buyers. It hosts a popular YouTube channel with over 70 million views per month, offering in-depth car reviews and the latest car news. The platform is also home to hundreds of independent reviews, providing unbiased insights into various car models. 

Carwow generates revenue through fees charged to dealers for each successful transaction. It also monetizes its YouTube channel through ad revenue. The company''s strong reputation, as evidenced by its ''Excellent'' rating on Trustpilot, indicates a high level of customer satisfaction and trust in its services.

