Ecoalf serves a diverse clientele, including men, women, and children, offering a wide range of products such as coats, jackets, hats, scarves, wallets, and stainless steel bottles. The company emphasizes practicality and sustainability in its designs, ensuring that each piece is not only stylish but also environmentally friendly. By focusing on recycled materials, Ecoalf reduces waste and promotes a circular economy, where products are designed to be reused and recycled, minimizing their environmental impact.

The company generates revenue through direct sales on its website, ecoalf.com, and through various retail partners. Additionally, Ecoalf engages in educational initiatives through the Ecoalf Foundation, which conducts conferences and activities to raise awareness about waste management and marine ecosystem conservation. This not only enhances the brand''s reputation but also aligns with its mission to promote sustainability.

Ecoalf has received significant recognition for its efforts, including being named the Most Environmentally Responsible Company in Spain in 2022 by the Merco Ranking and being part of the global top 5% of B Corp companies. The company is also committed to becoming a NET ZERO brand by 2030, further solidifying its dedication to environmental sustainability.

