Exoticca''s revenue is primarily generated through the sale of these vacation packages. They have established long-term partnerships with local providers around the world, enabling them to offer access to a wide range of destinations. The company also offers a Traveler’s App, which provides real-time updates and a direct line to their in-trip care team, available 24/7. This adds an extra layer of support and peace of mind for their customers during their travels.

