The company''s primary clients are direct-to-consumer (D2C) brands in sectors like beauty, apparel, home goods, and food and beverage, as well as advertising agencies. Fermat''s business model is centered on providing a no-code, subscription-based platform that allows retailers to build and test numerous unique storefronts tailored to individual customer journeys from social media, email, or SMS. This approach aims to enhance advertising effectiveness and customer engagement in a post-cookie world by creating a seamless path from ad to shop to sale. Revenue is generated through monthly subscription plans for individuals, teams, and enterprises, with options to purchase additional credits.

Fermat''s platform uses AI and machine learning to carry customer context—such as product likes and influencer engagement—throughout the shopping process. Key features include the ability to generate and test thousands of specific landing page experiences, create shoppable content, build custom offers and bundles without needing Shopify setup, and an experimentation platform with "Forever Links" that allow marketers to update campaign destinations without editing the original creative. The platform''s infrastructure includes a proprietary commerce graph that tracks anonymized consumer behavior to provide insights, integrations with e-commerce APIs, and scalable A/B testing frameworks. This allows brands like Glossier, BISSELL, and Unilever to create hyper-personalized funnels for various channels, including paid ads, influencers, and QR codes.

Keywords: AI commerce, personalized shopping, D2C platform, user journey optimization, no-code retail, ad-to-sale funnel, conversion rate optimization, e-commerce personalization, customer experience platform, social commerce', '["Media","Core AI","Subscription","SaaS","Content production","Generative AI","genAI Applications","Artificial Intelligence","Natural Language Processing","b2c","Early stage"]', '["startup","funded"]', 50.29, 18000, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{"year":2023,"revenue":681818,"ebitda":null,"profit":null,"rnd":null,"valuation":null,"employees":12},{"year":2024,"revenue":681818,"ebitda":null,"profit":null,"rnd":null,"valuation":null,"employees":13},{"year":2025,"revenue":681818,"ebitda":null,"profit":null,"rnd":null,"valuation":null,"employees":17},{"year":2026,"revenue":681818,"ebitda":null,"profit":null,"rnd":null,"valuation":null,"employees":18}]', '2026-11-05T15:53:55.756Z', 'GBP', '2026-11-05T15:53:55.756Z');

