Galgus serves a broad range of high-density environments, including aviation, rail, maritime, hospitality, stadiums, and smart cities. The business model involves two main approaches: selling its own branded Galgus APs with the CHT software embedded, and integrating its full software stack onto third-party hardware for special projects. This software-defined approach allows the company to offer a recurring revenue model through licensing, a contrast to the traditional hardware replacement cycle in the Wi-Fi industry. The company''s technology also includes an advanced location analytics platform that can track both connected and unconnected devices, even those with randomized MAC addresses, with up to 95% accuracy. This provides clients with detailed business intelligence on foot traffic, dwell times, and movement patterns. 

Headquartered in Seville, Spain, Galgus has expanded internationally with offices in Madrid, Montreal, Colombia, Peru, and Boston, USA. The company has secured a total of $7.09M in funding through multiple rounds, including support from investors like GED Capital, Mundi Ventures, GoHub Ventures, and Wayra. Its innovative solutions have been recognized with several awards, including Best European Scale-Up in Digital Infrastructure by EIT Digital. Galgus is also a member of the Wi-Fi Alliance and has been featured by Gartner as a leading provider of location analytics technology. 

Keywords: WiFi optimization, cognitive hotspot technology, location analytics, presence data, CHT software, wireless network management, distributed intelligence, high-density WiFi, Wi-Fi analytics, software-defined WiFi, network resource optimization, AI in networking, smart WiFi, access point software, location tracking, MAC randomization, real-time location systems, network performance, passenger WiFi, smart cities connectivity, telecom, connectivity, network intelligence, IoT connectivity, wireless communication', '["accelerator","database","sales","corporate learning management systems","accounting","Venture Capital","e-commerce platforms","Telecom","marketing","Subscription","SaaS","marketing automation","javascript graphics","customer relationship management","frameworks and libraries","development","event management","content management system","Communications Infrastructure","marketing analytics","marketing performance measurement","web frameworks","Telecommunications","b2b","WiFi","web servers","software framework","Horizon Europe","Hard Tech","programming languages","Commission","human resource","miscellaneous","programming","javascript libraries","intelligence and analytics","containers","Network Management","real user monitoring","analytics","devops","Seal of Excellence EC","Intelligent Systems","operating systems & computing languages","web analytics","javascript frameworks","Embedding Technology","Early stage","font scripts","IoT InternetOfThings","blogs","ui frameworks","accounting and finance","EIT Ecosystem","continuous integration","configuration management","containerization","operating systems","captcha","web tools and plugins"]', '["startup","vc_backed","funded"]', 57.53, 1900, 0, 0, 19999992, NULL, NULL, -138093, 2023, '[{"year":2022,"revenue":1714151,"ebitda":null,"profit":-1232246,"rnd":null,"valuation":19999992,"employees":52},{"year":2023,"revenue":3645674,"ebitda":null,"profit":-138093,"rnd":null,"valuation":19999992,"employees":78},{"yea