The core of Growth Intelligence''s offering is its AI-powered platform that analyzes the digital footprints of companies to predict their likelihood to make a purchase. It combines a client''s historical sales data (both successful and unsuccessful attempts) with extensive public data gathered from the internet. Using machine-learning algorithms, the system trains a unique AI for each client to identify signals indicating a company might be a good prospect. This allows sales and marketing teams to focus their efforts on businesses that are most likely to convert, thereby increasing efficiency. The platform provides recommendations on who to target, their potential value, and the optimal time and messaging for outreach. 

Growth Intelligence serves a diverse B2B client base, with a particular focus on the technology, telecommunications, insurance, and finance sectors. Its client roster has included prominent names such as American Express, FedEx, BT, and Lloyds Banking Group. The UK government has also utilized the platform to monitor the real-time effects of economic policies. The company generates revenue through subscriptions to its platform. Since its inception, Growth Intelligence has secured significant funding over multiple rounds, amassing a total of $9.18 million from investors including 24 Haymarket, 83NORTH, and MMC Ventures. Keywords: predictive marketing, B2B sales leads, lead generation, customer data analytics, machine learning, artificial intelligence, SaaS, sales intelligence, marketing automation, business intelligence, big data analytics, client prediction, Go-to-Market, GTM strategy, demand generation, sales forecasting, B2B marketing, account-based marketing, enterprise software', '["accelerator","Predictive Analytics","Venture Capital","Big Data","Core AI","SaaS","UKis Digital and technologies","domain name services","DT and LS","it infrastructure","uk is8 creative industries","b2b","Artificial Intelligence","Hard Tech","Commission","AI Applications","Analytics","Enterprise Software","Marketing","uk is8 digital and technologies","Early stage","Business Intelligence","Lead Generation","Marketing Analytics","Deep Tech","Machine Learning"]', '["startup","vc_backed","funded"]', 58.99, 50, 0, 0, 8500000, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{"year":2018,"revenue":969697,"ebitda":null,"profit":null,"rnd":null,"valuation":15454539,"employees":18},{"year":2019,"revenue":1666666,"ebitda":null,"profit":null,"rnd":null,"valuation":10200000,"employees":27},{"year":2020,"revenue":2499999,"ebitda":null,"profit":null,"rnd":null,"valuation":10200000,"employees":34},{"year":2021,"revenue":2499999,"ebitda":null,"profit":null,"rnd":null,"valuation":10200000,"employees":31},{"year":2022,"reve