Imperia SCM makes money by selling its software to businesses. The software helps businesses to automate and optimize their purchasing processes, plan their production based on real needs, and improve their sales forecasts. By using Imperia SCM''s software, businesses can save time, make better decisions, and increase customer satisfaction.

