The company''s business model is centered around the sale of a comprehensive range of hair care products through its e-commerce platform, joshwoodcolour.com, and select retail partners. The product line is designed to cater to a variety of hair colour needs and includes permanent hair colour, root concealers, glosses, and colour-specific shampoos and conditioners. A key differentiator for the brand is its emphasis on education and personalization. The company offers online consultations and detailed guides to help customers choose the right shade and achieve professional-looking results at home. This approach has enabled Josh Wood Colour to build a loyal customer base and establish itself as a trusted name in the competitive home hair care market.

