Jotelulu is a company that offers a cloud platform specifically designed for IT companies, enabling them to become cloud service providers for their customers. The platform allows these IT businesses to manage all their cloud services from a single point, simplifying operations and consolidating billing. The company''s portfolio of services includes servers, remote desktops, and storage solutions, all of which can be white-labeled and resold by their IT partners.

The business model is focused on the IT distribution channel. Jotelulu provides the infrastructure and a management layer, which allows smaller IT firms and managed service providers (MSPs) to offer cloud services without the need to build and maintain their own infrastructure. This model empowers them to compete with larger cloud providers. The platform is designed to be user-friendly, with features aimed at simplifying the sale, deployment, and management of cloud services, including automated invoicing and a marketplace for solutions.

