Vector search finds what''s similar. Graph reasoning finds what''s connected — following relationships, dependencies, and hierarchies that similarity alone can''t capture. Modern AI systems need both, and Memgraph is the graph layer - surfacing precise structural context with full audit trails in sub-millisecond time. 

It serves as the graph engine for GraphRAG pipelines, AI memory systems, and agentic workflows — a single high-performance layer for any system that needs structured, connected context. The same in-memory architecture drives real-time graph analytics for fraud detection, network analysis, infrastructure monitoring, and other operational workloads where milliseconds matter.

NASA uses Memgraph to connect people, skills, and projects across the agency into a queryable knowledge graph that powers real-time expert discovery and workforce planning. Cedars-Sinai uses it to link genes, drugs, and clinical pathways in an Alzheimer''s knowledge graph spanning over 230,000 entities that drives drug repurposing research and multi-hop biomedical reasoning. Organizations across cybersecurity, finance, retail, and other knowledge-intensive domains rely on Memgraph for the same reason: sub-millisecond graph traversals for the structured context and real-time insight that modern systems demand.

Keywords:  in-memory graph database, real-time analytics, graph computation, streaming data, fraud detection, cybersecurity, network analysis, knowledge graphs, openCypher, ACID transactions, data relationships, GraphRAG, vector search, MAGE, Dominik Tomicevic, Marko Budiselic, real-time graph applications, enterprise AI, supply chain optimization, data exploration, identity and access management, recommendation engines, developer tools', '["accelerator","data management","database","sales","paas","Venture Capital","web fonts","Big Data","editors","ad exchanges","marketing","Core AI","Subscription","SaaS","marketing automation","customer relationship management","page builders","Angel","frameworks and libraries","communication and collaboration","development","content management system","other advertising software","Big Data and Analytics","online video platforms","marketing analytics","system analytics & monitoring","marketing performance measurement","it infrastructure","web frameworks","b2b","Artificial Intelligence","tag management","team collaboration","widgets","web servers","search marketing","customer service","content delivery network","programming languages","Breakout stage","audio-video-graphics","advertising","payment processing","website builders","web and application servers","miscellaneous","programming","caching","AI Applications","cloud infrastructure computing","javascript libraries","intelligence and analytics","video players","Enterprise Software","analytics","devops","sales performance management","operating systems & computing languages","cloud hosting","web analytics","data integration","platform as a service","uk is8 digital and technologies","build automation","javascript frameworks","live chat","communications technology","font scripts","lead generation","social networks","design","continuous integration","configuration management","Machine Learning","project management","operating systems","captcha","web tools and plugins","web hosting"]',