The platform utilizes AI voice agents, omnichannel outreach, and behavioral personalization to manage and recover non-performing loans. It operates 24/7 across more than 100 languages through channels including SMS, email, and voice calls. The system is designed to automate interactions, manage payment negotiations, handle installment plans, and integrate with existing ERP and accounting systems. Murphy AI reports that its approach can increase recovery rates by 40% and reduce the time spent on collections by 75%. 

The company targets a wide range of clients, including debt collection agencies (DCAs) and enterprises such as banks, telecommunications providers, utility companies, and BNPL firms. In July 2025, Murphy AI announced it had raised €12.8 million (approximately $15 million) in pre-seed and seed funding. The round was led by Northzone, with participation from Lakestar, Seedcamp, ElevenLabs, and Enzo Ventures. The capital is intended to scale the product, expand its technical and go-to-market teams, and accelerate international expansion into Europe and the United States. 

Keywords: debt servicing, AI agents, debt collection, non-performing loans, accounts receivable, omnichannel outreach, financial software, behavioral personalization, payment recovery, automated collections, fintech, AI voice agents, loan recovery, revenue recovery, credit management, SaaS, regulatory compliance, financial services automation, multilingual platform', '["data management","human resource management system","Venture Capital","Subscription","SaaS","social sharing","frameworks and libraries","deployment","identity and access management","Fintech","software development","payroll management and benefits administration","it infrastructure","travel and expense management","b2b","Artificial Intelligence","it infrastructure & operations management","out of stealth","content delivery network","programming languages","Commission","Breakout stage","audio-video-graphics","web & portal technology","governance-risk and compliance","email security","javascript libraries","Enterprise Software","other audio-video-graphics software","security","issue trackers","operating systems & computing languages","javascript frameworks","live chat","communications technology","payroll processing","file sharing","big data processing","accounting and finance","certificates","continuous integration","operating systems"]', '["startup","rising_star","vc_backed","funded"]', 86.03, 26000, 1, 57, 68181791, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T15:55:23.556Z', 'GBP', '2026-11-05T15:55:23.556Z');

