The firm''s core business revolves around a borderless lending model that assesses a student''s future earning potential rather than relying on traditional metrics like credit history, collateral, or a co-signer. This approach specifically addresses the challenges international students face when seeking funding from conventional banks, which often require local credit history or assets that these students do not possess. Prodigy Finance provides loans for postgraduate programs in fields such as business, engineering, law, public policy, and health sciences at over 450 universities worldwide. The application process is conducted entirely online, where students can get a provisional offer within days. Once documents are verified and the loan is confirmed, funds are disbursed directly to the university.

Prodigy Finance generates revenue primarily through the interest on the loans it provides. It also charges an administration fee for processing the loans. The company''s funding model is community-based, sourcing capital from a mix of institutional investors, alumni, and qualified private investors who are attracted by both a financial and social return. Over the years, Prodigy has secured significant funding from entities like the U.S. International Development Finance Corporation (DFC), Index Ventures, Balderton Capital, Credit Suisse, and Deutsche Bank. As of late 2024, the company has disbursed over $2.3 billion in loans to more than 43,000 students from over 150 countries. A significant portion of these borrowers come from emerging economies, with many being first-generation students.

Keywords: international student loans, postgraduate funding, MBA financing, no-collateral loans, no-cosigner loans, education finance, fintech, future earning potential, master''s degree loans, borderless lending, INSEAD, social impact investing, community-funded loans, study abroad financing, graduate school loans, student lending platform, UK fintech, law school loans, engineering degree funding, public policy education loans', '["data management","static site generator","database","uk is8 financial services","data security","sales","corporate learning management systems","paas","payments","accounting","chat","human resource management system","hr","hris management","Venture Capital","network hardware","web fonts","recruitment marketing","payroll","visual and user generated content marketing","marketing","sales enablement","javascript graphics","customer relationship management","human resources","Angel","Education","frameworks and libraries","communication and collaboration","development","identity and access management","Education Management","event management","testing and qa","content management system","Consumer Lending","Fintech","storage","other advertising software","online video platforms","enterprise","marketing analytics","system analytics & monitoring","software development","payroll management and benefits administration","it infrastructure","web frameworks","source code management","wikis","open source","help desk management","data warehousing","learning management system","Education Financing","tag management","databases","advanced analytics and data science","it infrastructure & operations management","team collaboration","widgets","Student","human resource management","enterprise mobility management","software framework","Higher Education","content delivery network","programming languages","documentation tools","Commission","Breakout stage","audio-video-graphics","advertising","infrastructure as a service","software","crm","human resource","error 