The company''s business model revolves around providing access to live compensation data from leading tech companies. This data is a crucial tool for businesses to build a compensation strategy that is not only fair but also competitive. This data-driven approach eliminates guesswork and outdated spreadsheets, allowing businesses to make informed decisions about their compensation strategies. 

Ravio.com also offers insights into market trends, such as pay increases, hiring and attrition rates, and popular benefits packages. This information is crucial for businesses to stay competitive in the rapidly evolving tech industry. 

The company makes money by providing these services to tech companies. By partnering with Ravio.com, businesses can access reliable benchmarking data for the positions they are hiring for, saving them time and resources. 

In summary, Ravio.com is a valuable tool for tech companies looking to develop a competitive and fair compensation strategy. The company''s data-driven approach allows businesses to make informed decisions about their compensation strategies, helping them to attract and retain top talent in the competitive tech industry. 

