In addition to its AI technology, Seedtag also offers creative services. The company has an in-house design studio that can create over 150 different configurations tailored to the specific Key Performance Indicators (KPIs) of an advertising campaign. This means that Seedtag can provide a highly customized service to its clients, helping them boost their engagement and achieve their advertising goals.

Seedtag operates in the digital advertising market, serving both advertisers and publishers. The company''s business model is based on providing premium media, powered by over 8,000 trusted publishers. This means that Seedtag makes money by helping advertisers place their ads on high-quality, trusted media platforms, thereby increasing the effectiveness of their advertising campaigns.

In summary, Seedtag is a digital advertising startup that uses AI technology and creative services to help advertisers and publishers engage with their audiences more effectively. The company operates in the digital advertising market and makes money by providing premium media placements on trusted platforms.

