Shalion''s Digital Shelf Monitor enables brands to compare their online retail performance with competitors, providing valuable insights for strategic decision-making. Another key offering is the Visibility & eRetail Media Tracker, which helps brands increase their visibility and improve the return on investment (ROI) of their product and brand campaigns. This is achieved by monitoring the evolution of a brand''s visibility on search, ad spaces, share of shelf, and promotions.

Shalion also offers a unique service called Share of Shelf, which helps brands grow their share of visibility for their products. The company prides itself on its ability to collect complex data across hundreds of retailers, making it a valuable partner for brands seeking to enhance their online retail presence. 

Shalion operates in over 50 countries, demonstrating its global reach and adaptability to diverse eCommerce landscapes. The company''s proprietary technology enables it to quickly adapt to changes in the eCommerce environment, providing its clients with an edge over their competitors.

