The platform provides a suite of tools accessible via a mobile app, which includes features for scheduling, time and attendance tracking, payroll, and communication. A key component of their offering is the integration of Agentic AI, which provides managers with AI-powered insights and custom reporting to analyze workforce performance and identify location-specific trends. This technology aims to automate administrative tasks, allowing managers to focus on team leadership and operational efficiency.

