Sunhero handles all the necessary paperwork for the photovoltaic system, including licenses and legalization. They also assist clients with available subsidies for self-consumption. The company provides continuous monitoring and guarantees for the solar panel system even after installation. 

One of Sunhero''s unique selling points is its flexible payment methods. They offer solar panel financing for up to 12 years without the need for an initial investment. This includes a fixed monthly fee starting from 39 euros per month, with the first payment due two months after installation. Financing can be extended up to 144 months, and product warranties last up to 25 years. 

Sunhero also offers maintenance plans and helps clients take advantage of subsidies and tax incentives to reduce the investment cost of their photovoltaic system. The company''s specialists analyze clients'' current electricity bills and plan a system according to their future needs. By generating and consuming their own renewable energy, clients can become independent from electric companies and save up to 70% on their electricity bills. 

Keywords: Solar Energy, Solar Panel Installation, Renewable Energy, Photovoltaic System, Flexible Payment, Financing, Subsidies, Self-Consumption, Energy Independence, Energy Savings.', '["accelerator","sales","Venture Capital","operations","recruitment marketing","Solar Energy","marketing","marketing automation","customer relationship management","Urban Tech","Affordable And Clean Energy (#7)","online video platforms","marketing analytics","marketing performance measurement","Residential Solar","b2b","Energy","tag management","email","Hard Tech","Energy Providers","Sustainable Cities And Communities (#11)","content delivery network","programming languages","Commission","audio-video-graphics","advertising","Manufacturing","Clean Energy","enterprise resource planning","business intelligence","account-based marketing","intelligence and analytics","video players","real user monitoring","analytics","devops","erp","security","Sustainable Development Goals","Green Buildings","Climate Tech","load balancers","web analytics","Renewable Energy","b2c","consent management","Early stage","applicant tracking systems","tools","affiliate advertising networks","email marketing","continuous integration"]', '["startup","vc_backed","funded"]', 60.96, 870, 0, 0, 49999980, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T15:55:36.049Z', 'GBP', '2026-11-05T15:55:36.049Z');

