The company operates a carbon intelligence platform that provides ratings, analytics, and market data to help organizations invest in high-quality carbon credits. Sylvera''s software automates the evaluation of projects that capture, remove, or avoid emissions by leveraging geospatial data, machine learning, and proprietary climate data. The platform assesses projects based on carbon performance, additionality, and permanence, providing a discrete letter rating (AAA-D) and in-depth reports. This allows clients, which include corporations, governments, and financial services institutions, to confidently benchmark, deliver, and report on their climate impact. Its business model is based on providing end-to-end solutions for the procurement of carbon instruments and investment in carbon projects through subscriptions to its platform and API. 

Sylvera has experienced significant growth, raising a total of $99.6M over 6 funding rounds. Its latest funding was a $57 million Series B round in July 2023, led by Balderton Capital, with participation from investors like Index Ventures, Insight Partners, and Salesforce Ventures. This funding is aimed at expanding its US operations, with an office in New York, and scaling its product and engineering teams. The platform offers a range of tools including the ''Sylvera Project Catalog,'' which aggregates data from major registries to help users discover and compare nearly 20,000 projects, and ''Screenings,'' which provides high-level assessments of project quality and risk. 

Keywords: carbon data, carbon credits, carbon offset ratings, voluntary carbon market, climate finance, net-zero, emissions reduction, geospatial data, machine learning, ESG investing, climate technology, carbon accounting, project finance, climate risk, decarbonization, carbon removal, additionality, permanence, climate action, market intelligence', '["accelerator","data management","database","Climate Fintech","MRV","Space Tech for Finance","software as a service","Venture Capital","recruitment marketing","Climate Action (#13)","ad exchanges","mobile application development platforms","Core AI","SaaS","sales enablement","marketing automation","human resources","page builders","Forestry","Angel","content management system","UKis Digital and technologies","performance","domain name services","software development","DT and LS","web frameworks","customer data platforms","data warehousing","b2b","Artificial Intelligence","Energy","tag management","advanced analytics and data science","web servers","software framework","Space Tech for Environment","Hard Tech","content delivery network","programming languages","social media analytics and monitoring","Commission","Breakout stage","advertising","Nature Fintech","website builders","customer communication management","generative ai","miscellaneous","programming","AI Applications","Carbon Tracking & Offset","business intelligence","food ordering and delivery","UKis clean energy","Satellite Imagery","javascript libraries","intelligence and analytics","Enterprise Software","real user monitoring","analytics","Life On Land (#15)","devops","Sustainable Development Goals","issue trackers","Climate Tech","science-based","operating systems & computing languages","web analytics","Space Tech","uk is8 professional business services","Biodiversity","uk is8 digital and technologies","application development & management","consent management","Industrial Technology","blogs","uk is8 clean energy industries","applicant tracking systems","ui 