The company promises to save clients 20-30% annually on their SaaS and cloud spending. It achieves this by handling the renewal process or new software purchases, allowing businesses to focus on their core operations. Vertice.One also offers a service to reduce cloud costs by providing detailed insights into cloud spending and making automated savings recommendations. 

One of the unique features of Vertice.One is RIO, a reserved instance optimizer that automates the buying and selling of reserved instances using advanced demand forecasting, potentially saving clients up to 60% of their compute spend. 

The platform provides a comprehensive view of a company''s SaaS tools and cloud infrastructure, ensuring legal compliance and integrating with all major ERP finance, contract management systems, ticketing, and SSO providers. 

In summary, Vertice.One is a financial technology platform that helps businesses optimize their SaaS and cloud spending, promising significant savings and increased efficiency.

