The service is positioned as an all-in-one job search tool for technology professionals. For job seekers, it offers features to discover job openings, message hiring managers directly, manage applications, and benchmark salaries. For companies, Cord provides access to a pool of responsive candidates, with a reported 30% of them exclusively using the platform for their job search. The platform includes AI-powered tools such as candidate recommendations and summaries, programmatic advertising of job positions, an interview scheduler that integrates with Google and Outlook calendars, and tools to reduce unconscious bias in sourcing. It also offers integrations with Applicant Tracking Systems (ATS) like Workable, Greenhouse, and Lever. The company serves a range of technology-led businesses, from recent Y-Combinator alumni to publicly listed corporations.

Originally launched as a niche messaging tool for JavaScript developers in London, Cord has expanded significantly. It reports having over 250,000 developers, more than 4,000 companies, and over 16,000 live positions on its platform, establishing it as a substantial job search platform for developers in the UK. The company has facilitated over 150,000 direct conversations between candidates and hiring teams. As the platform has grown, so has its dataset, enabling it to generate insights into hiring trends, such as which companies attract the most applications. The company has stated its mission is to increase the number of people doing their best work by providing better tools to find it.

Keywords: tech hiring, job search platform, direct hiring, developer jobs, recruitment platform, tech recruitment, IT jobs, hiring managers, direct messaging, UK tech jobs, software engineer jobs, salary benchmark, application management, tech talent, engineering roles, startup jobs, hiring solutions, candidate sourcing, recruitment technology, tech careers', '["personalization","data management","social media marketing software","database","software as a service","data security","sales","corporate learning management systems","recurring billing","human resource management system","hris management","Venture Capital","network hardware","recruitment marketing","online form builders","live streaming platforms","it service management","augmented reality","product information management","marketing","business process management","SaaS","sales enablement","marketing automation","transportation and fleet management","mobile apps","customer relationship management","human resources","page builders","Angel","endpoint protection","frameworks and libraries","time tracking","real estate property management","communication and collaboration","hotel reservations","content management system","job board software","marketing analytics","system analytics & monitoring","risk and compliance","backup and recovery","software development","payroll management and benefits administration","it infrastructure","web frameworks","travel and expense management","database management","learning management system","b2b","web platform extensions","unified communications","message boards","tag management","corporate performance management","advanced analytics and data science","email","demand side platforms","team collaboration","web servers","search engines","enterprise mobility management","software framework","online review management","threat intelligence","retail operations software","programming languages","social media analytics and monitoring","Breakout stage","audio-video-graphics","advertis