The company''s primary service is a mobile application that provides tools for personal financial management. It automatically categorizes user expenses, tracks accounts, and offers monthly forecasts to help users manage their money. A key feature is the "FinScore," a proprietary credit scoring system that assesses a user''s financial health to facilitate access to better financing conditions. Fintonic''s business model is centered on its marketplace, where it earns commissions by connecting users with financial products from over 50 partner entities. The company provides access to personal loans, insurance, investment products like indexed funds, and interest-bearing accounts. The service is free for users, as revenue is generated from the financial institutions and service providers on its platform. 

Headquartered in Madrid, Spain, Fintonic has expanded its operations to include Mexico and Chile. Over its history, the company has raised a total of $54.8 million over several funding rounds, with its latest Series D round in June 2023. Major investors include ING Ventures, PSN Group, Atresmedia, and Onza Capital. The company is licensed by the Bank of Spain to provide account information and payment initiation services, complying with the European PSD2 directive. 

Keywords: personal finance, fintech, financial management, loan marketplace, account aggregation, credit score, FinScore, insurance brokerage, expense tracking, savings tools, investment platform, PSD2, online lending, consumer finance, mobile banking, financial wellness, Lupina Iturriaga, Sergio Chalbaud, Marcos Icardo, Madrid fintech', '["corporate","data security","Insurtech Distribution and Brokerage","help desk software","Venture Capital","web fonts","online form builders","editors","ad exchanges","Subscription","SaaS","marketing automation","page builders","Angel","frameworks and libraries","testing and qa","Consumer Lending","Fintech","performance","domain name services","software development","it infrastructure","web frameworks","wikis","open source","help desk management","web platform extensions","tag management","Insurance","email","team collaboration","widgets","web servers","search engines","customer service","content delivery network","programming languages","social media analytics and monitoring","Commission","Breakout stage","audio-video-graphics","advertising","website builders","web & portal technology","web and application servers","cloud infrastructure computing","business intelligence","governance-risk and compliance","Financial Management Solutions","dev tools","javascript libraries","wordpress plugins","intelligence and analytics","real user monitoring","analytics","devops","customer feedback management","Techscale200","issue trackers","Personal Finance","cloud hosting","web analytics","platform as a service","b2c","application development & management","javascript frameworks","consent management","Marketplace & ecommerce","live chat","font scripts","Mortgages & Lending","social networks","Mobile app","design","ui frameworks","certificates","continuous integration","Woman Founder","web tools and plugins","web hosting","retargeting"]', '["startup","vc_backed","funded"]', 83.6, 190000, 1, 1, 133333280, NULL, NULL, -10163827, 2023, '[{"year":2016