The firm''s core offering is a software-as-a-service (SaaS) platform that provides AI-powered voice solutions for businesses. These agents are built on ultra-low latency models, allowing them to engage in human-like conversations with customers around the clock. The technology is designed to integrate into a client''s existing systems, with Flyboard AI managing the implementation process. The business model aims to provide the performance of human agents at a reduced cost, helping clients increase sales conversions and reduce operational expenses. 

Flyboard AI''s services address several use cases across the customer lifecycle. These include lead activation, where the AI converts cold leads into engaged customers; AI-assisted lead forms, which guide customers through information capture before a seamless transfer to a human agent; and subscription win-back campaigns that re-engage churned customers with personalized offers. The platform also facilitates upselling, cross-selling, and maximizing conversions after free trials. 

The company targets a range of industries, including energy (specifically utilities and installers of solar, HVAC, and heat pumps), insurance, e-commerce, retail, and education. In December 2025, the company secured early-stage venture capital funding from b2venture. 

Keywords: AI voice agents, customer engagement automation, sales automation, support automation, multilingual AI models, low latency voice AI, lead activation, subscription winback, AI-assisted lead forms, SaaS, Evoltio Labs, b2venture, business productivity software, customer interaction, automated outreach, churn reduction, conversion optimization, upselling AI, customer retention', '["Venture Capital","SaaS","marketing automation","frameworks and libraries","Generative AI","web frameworks","b2b","genAI Applications","Artificial Intelligence","software framework","programming languages","audio-video-graphics","payment processing","cloud infrastructure computing","e-commerce","Enterprise Software","other audio-video-graphics software","security","cloud hosting","Marketing","platform as a service","javascript frameworks","Early stage","ui frameworks","email marketing","ai model layer"]', '["startup","rising_star","vc_backed","funded"]', 89.04, 1400, 1, 3, 9499996, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T15:56:04.243Z', 'GBP', '2026-11-05T15:56:04.243Z');

